text The boss calls me over as I'm changing clothes.
sound MUY.aac
text @[Boss]
text Sorry, Okazaki-kun. Could you hold on for just a minute?
text @[Tomoya]
text What's the matter?
sound MUZ.aac
text @[Boss]
text You see, some urgent work came up and Yoshino suddenly got called over to another site, so he's not here.
text @[Tomoya]
text So what about today's plans?
sound MV0.aac
