text I take off running.
text It'd be best if I could take a bus, but unfortunately, I don't know what line gets there.
text I just know the path to take by foot; regrettably it's quite a distance.
text But I have to go, no matter what.
text Yoshino-san knows that I just have to go to the school festival today.
text That's why he just keeps saying that it was "his mistake."
text I don't want to leave Nagisa on her own.
text But I'd hate even more leaving Yoshino-san to deal with this by himself.
text There's still time until the festival begins.
text I'll go to the site, apologize, finish my work, then head to school.
text I'll make it in time. I have to.
