	fi
fi
sound MWP.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text What's the matter? Just focus on having fun today.
text @[Tomoya]
text If you force me to go back to school in this state, I'll only make her sad.
text @[Tomoya]
text I... can't lie to her.
text @[Tomoya]
text So there's no way I'll be able to honestly enjoy myself.
text @[Tomoya]
text And I won't even be able to face her unless I take accountability for my own mistakes.
text @[Tomoya]
text That's why I have to do this work.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGYS16H"
