	fi
fi
sound MWQ.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text You're a real idiot, you know that?
text @[Tomoya]
text You're right.
text Yoshino-san brushes his bangs out of the way.
sound MWR.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text ...Bring me six meters of twenty-five low-voltage insulation tube. Now.
text @[Tomoya]
text Huh...?
